stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CHECK_IGN

    CHECK_IGN --> DRIVING : ignition = ON
    CHECK_IGN --> PARKED : ignition = OFF

    DRIVING --> DRIVING : GNSS + OBD-II + publish
    DRIVING --> PARKED : ignition OFF

    PARKED --> HEARTBEAT : timer wake
    PARKED --> ALARM : IMU phát hiện rung
    PARKED --> DRIVING : ignition ON trở lại

    HEARTBEAT --> PARKED : tiếp tục theo dõi nền
    HEARTBEAT --> SLEEP : đã flush dữ liệu<br>không rung<br>ignition vẫn OFF

    ALARM --> PARKED : đã gửi cảnh báo
    ALARM --> DRIVING : ignition ON trở lại

    SLEEP --> HEARTBEAT : RTC wake
    SLEEP --> ALARM : IMU wake
    SLEEP --> DRIVING : ignition ON
